    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35093" root="قبض" body-key="q">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قابضهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَابَضَةٌ</span> (AZ, A) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِبَاضٌ</span>,
(Er-Rághib, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شرى</span>,) <i>He bartered,</i> or
<i>exchanged commodities, with him.</i> (AZ, in TA,
art, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خوص</span>.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَايَضَهُ</span>.]

